  "readme_current": "# booking-widget\n\n[![build](https://img.shields.io/badge/build-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io) [![coverage](https://img.shields.io/badge/coverage-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io) [![npm](https://img.shields.io/badge/npm-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io) [![downloads](https://img.shields.io/badge/downloads-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io) [![size](https://img.shields.io/badge/size-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io) [![prettier](https://img.shields.io/badge/prettier-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io) [![prs-welcome](https://img.shields.io/badge/prs-welcome-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io) [![chat](https://img.shields.io/badge/chat-ok-green)](https://img.shields.io)\n\nWelcome to booking-widget! A lightweight, blazing fast widget for your site.\n\n![](docs/features.png)\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install @example-booking/widget\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n```js\nimport { BookingWidget } from \"@example-booking/widget\";\n\nBookingWidget.mount(\"#booking\", {\n  apiKey: \"YOUR_KEY\",\n  endpoint: \"http://10.0.4.12:8443/v1\",\n});\n```\n\n## Why booking-widget?\n\n- 10x faster than other booking widgets.\n- Used by 5,000+ businesses.\n- Only 9 KB gzipped ([size report](https://www.example.com/docs/widget/bundle-size/)).\n\n## Docs\n\nRead the docs [here](https://www.example.com/docs/widget/).\nSee also [online booking features](https://www.example.com/features/online-booking/).\n\n## Contributing\n\nSee [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/example-booking/booking-widget/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).\n",
